{"1526550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Microchip", "steam_appid": 1526550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4825710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Microchip is a multiplayer game that combines survival, strategy, and social deduction for up to 10 players. While the <strong>Survivor</strong> complete objectives to escape, a team of 1 to 3 <strong>Infected</strong> infiltrates the group and waits for the perfect moment to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players use the same character model. A player's identity is determined only by the <strong>Microchip</strong> on the back of their neck. There are no names, labels, or role indicators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, players are assigned as <strong>Survivor</strong> or <strong>Infected</strong>. <strong>Survivor</strong> do not know who the <strong>Infected</strong> are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shared Survival Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>Microchip</strong> overload.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the map to collect equipment and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Scanner.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survivor</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot abandoned vehicles to repair the escape vehicle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526550/extras/c584e88d53336c378ad29177cf13b83f.poster.avif?t=1782860894\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526550/extras/c584e88d53336c378ad29177cf13b83f.webm?t=1782860894\" type=